PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE
MINUTES
Due to the Labor Day holiday a meeting of the Public Services Committee was instead held on
Wednesday. September 4, 2024, in Committee Room 104 and via electronic meeting. starting at
12:00 pm. Those in attendance were as follows:
COMMITTEE MENIBERS: Scott Roybal. Chairman: Pete Laybourn; Dr. Rinne; and Tom
Segrave.
AGENDA ITEMS
7.
ORDINANCE _3rd READING
— Annexing to the Cit
of Cheyenne, Wyoming, land
located west of Converse Avenue and north of Dell Range Boulevard.
Mr. Segrave moved to approve on 3rd arid tinal reading, seconded by Mr. Layboum. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report.
8.
ORDINANCE —3” READING
— Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne establishing the zoning classification of AG Agricultural for land annexed to the
City of Cheyenne located west of Converse Avenue and north of Dell Range Boulevard.
Mr. Laybourn moved to approve on 3” and final reading, seconded by Mr. Segrave,
Motion
carried by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report.
9.
ORDINANCE
READING
— Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne changing the zoning classification from AG Agricultural to NR-3 Neighborhood
Residential
- High Density for land located west of Converse Avenue and north of Dell
Range Boulevard.
Mr. Segrave moved to approve on 3” and final reading, seconded by Dr. Rinne. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White. Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report.
10.
ORDINANCE —3 READING
— Annexing to the City of Cheyenne. Wyoming. land
located east of US-30 and north of and adjacent to East Pershing Boulevard.
Mr. Layboum moved to approve on 3” and final reading, seconded by Dr. R.inne. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
